ant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","review_id":"Y_F14v8b7m8NFzW_f_iMbw","date":"2016-05-30T01:32:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9516167640686035,"text_excerpt":"This place was just cool. Small venue and generally I don't like live music but this felt very old school, jazzy without being too artsy, with really nice drinks. Had a Moscow mule here and i could taste the ginger so distinctly. Also the band that was playing was quite talented one guy was playing the clarinet and sax at the exact same time. Not too many seats and very small. But worth stopping by to listen to the music and grab a drink. Definitely a cut above those other gross bourbon street bars - clean, nice drinks, no one puking or stumbling around. I would def tell any friends coming to the French quarter to stop by here for a chill drink."},{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","review_id":"yfsKHko7sRQKdcLM7H-HZQ","date":"2017-03-09T03:06:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9399809241294861,"text_excerpt":"Amazing bar with a live jazz band and tasty drinks. I enjoyed my time and would highly recommend going back. It's also a nice place to get away from the craziness of Bourbon Street."},{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","review_id":"yAI2MoO_zWTP0Wr8SglbEw","date":"2017-07-23T20:00:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.939949631690979,"text_excerpt":"I love this bar. It's a charming throwback to Prohibition days and it's surprisingly upscale and classy given its proximity to Bourbon St. There's fantastic live music every night and super cool decor reminiscent of 21 in NYC. Think gangster chic. But, the best part of this little jazz club is the cocktails -- if you're lucky enough to visit 21st Amendment on a night when Scott is working, you're lucky enough. He's warm and welcoming and he is an expert at craft cocktails. I've got nothing bad to say about this cozy spot other than that it's on the other side of the Quarter from where I live. I wish it were closer, but it is worth the walk, every time. Cheers!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","photo_id":"Xz0C9kgB2DroWJna6IiJIA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Xz0C9kgB2DroWJna6IiJIA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9335797429084778},{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","photo_id":"_1_bC1M__aUYPkCmG57xgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/_1_bC1M__aUYPkCmG57xgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8883381485939026},{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","photo_id":"dN_a_75z4X-i83ilGRWcGA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/dN_a_75z4X-i83ilGRWcGA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.881335973739624},{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","photo_id":"pl8gcFLVEEHYDgABFG4dKQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pl8gcFLVEEHYDgABFG4dKQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8461577892303467},{"business_id":"JLixvCikc5JYGcnvaqHoJg","photo_id":"Ek55KKYdHydjaUwgmgcauA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Ek55KKYdHydjaUwgmgcauA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8278374075889587}]},"notebook_case":null}
